			<message type="agent_text" content="&lt;p&gt;The model is now clean — no errors, no warnings. Here&amp;#39;s a summary of what was done:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Original issue:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;mal.community handling capability&lt;/code&gt; had a unit warning because &lt;code&gt;malaria_policy_implementation_date&lt;/code&gt; was declared with units &lt;code&gt;time&lt;/code&gt; instead of &lt;code&gt;year&lt;/code&gt; (the model&amp;#39;s time unit). The &lt;code&gt;TIME &amp;gt;= malaria_policy_implementation_date&lt;/code&gt; comparison was therefore dimensionally inconsistent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fix 1:&lt;/strong&gt; Changed &lt;code&gt;mal.malaria_policy_implementation_date&lt;/code&gt; units from &lt;code&gt;time&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;year&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exposed pre-existing issue:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixing the unit warning revealed that &lt;code&gt;unmet.community_handling_capability&lt;/code&gt; was a broken ghost — it had no equation and its &lt;code&gt;crossLevelGhostOf&lt;/code&gt; binding to &lt;code&gt;mal.community handling capability&lt;/code&gt; couldn&amp;#39;t propagate to the Kenya element within the module context.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fix 2:&lt;/strong&gt; Converted &lt;code&gt;unmet.community_handling_capability&lt;/code&gt; from a broken ghost into a proper variable with explicit &lt;code&gt;arrayEquations&lt;/code&gt; for all 14 area elements, replicating the same conditional logic as the source &lt;code&gt;mal&lt;/code&gt; variable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fix 3:&lt;/strong&gt; Created 6 supporting ghost variables in the &lt;code&gt;unmet&lt;/code&gt; module to expose the &lt;code&gt;mal&lt;/code&gt; policy inputs that &lt;code&gt;unmet.community_handling_capability&lt;/code&gt; needs (&lt;code&gt;community_handling_lake_endemic&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;community_handling_lake_endemic_coastal_endemic_and_Turkana&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;no_community_handling&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;community_handling_all&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;malaria_policy_implementation_date&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;initial_community_handling_capability&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
