			<view isee:name="Landing Page with image" isee:original_design="Deluxe Prev-Next Blue Green Pastel" background="white" page_width="1066" page_height="600" zoom="145" home_view="true" type="interface">
				<style>
					<isee:stacked_container item_spacing="0" corner_radius="4" selected_item_color="black" selected_item_background="white" item_background="#DDDDDD" transparent_bg="false"/>
				</style>
				<text_box z_index="1" font_color="#A5A5A5" font_size="14pt" appearance="transparent" x="79.2736" y="327.11" width="367.273" height="72">This model has been developed to help policy makers in Kenya to understand the implications of alternative policies and scenarios on Community health promoter service outcomes</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="1" font_weight="bold" font_color="#29017F" font_size="28pt" appearance="transparent" x="25.5758" y="50.533" width="457.182" height="201">COMMUNITY HEALTH PROMOTERS in KENYA
- A MODEL TO SUPPORT UNDERSTANDING, PREDICTION AND POLICY DECISION MAKING</text_box>
				<button z_index="1" background="#3C6E71" font_family="Arial Rounded MT Bold" font_size="18pt" border_width="thin" border_style="none" corner_radius="26" isee:flat="false" isee:highlight_on_hover="true" label="LET'S LOOK" isee:tooltip="" x="141.608" y="431.93" width="173.091" height="44.5455">
					<actions>
						<action target="next_page">navigate</action>
					</actions>
				</button>
				<isee:shape z_index="1" border_color="#284B63" border_width="6" x="79.7442" y="281.028" width="401.053" height="18.9344" kind="hline"/>
				<graphics_frame fill="none" x="159.373" y="-5.54902" width="922.667" height="617.333">
					<image width="906" height="714" size_to_parent="true" isee:transparency="0" isee:fixed_aspect_ratio="true">C:/Users/clair/OneDrive - The University of Queensland/Kenya/Presentations/pics/CHP screenshot.jpg</image>
				</graphics_frame>
				<isee:shape background="#F7F7F7" border_color="#284B63" border_width="5" border_style="none" transparent_background="false" x="20.3333" y="-4.19608" width="510.667" height="649.333" isee:locked="true" kind="rectangle"/>
			</view>
			<view isee:template_view="template:10" isee:name="Home page" isee:original_design="Deluxe Prev-Next Blue Green Pastel" background="white" page_width="1066" page_height="600" zoom="145" type="interface">
				<style>
					<isee:stacked_container item_spacing="0" corner_radius="4" selected_item_color="black" selected_item_background="white" item_background="#DDDDDD" transparent_bg="false"/>
				</style>
				<text_box z_index="5" font_weight="bold" text_align="center" vertical_text_align="bottom" font_color="#004E75" font_size="36pt" appearance="transparent" x="30.0429" y="50.4346" width="984" height="58.2449">MODEL STRUCTURE</text_box>
				<text_box font_color="#353535" font_size="14pt" padding="10" vertical_scrollbar="true" appearance="transparent" x="737.862" y="125.572" width="307.451" height="414.877">This model focuses on three aspects of CHP services;
the CHPs themselves, the services they deliver and the supplies they need. 

CHPs deliver urgent services and routine services; through visiting their allocated households on a regular basis.

They can only deliver some services if they have appropriate supplies, e.g. blood glucose test strips. 

Community trust is important to CHPs; it motivates them and is impacted by both CHP availability and supply availability.   

The model runs from 2020 to 2040 and is fitted to existing data from KHIS and eCHIS, two Kenyan Health Information systems. 

It assumes population growth in line with United Nations forecasts. </text_box>
