				<text_box border_color="#00557F" border_width="2" border_style="solid" x="27.8846" y="98.592" width="146.154" height="431.501">These results show CHP contribution to RMNCH.
 
Tab 1 
CHP modelled visits to  antenatal clients and children less then 1 years old. 

Tab 2
CHP modelled visits to under 5 years olds, compared with eCHIS records of visits (possibly overstated) and eCHIS records of referrals  

Tab 3
CHP modelled diarrhoea treatment  

Tab 4 
Immunization education CHP opportunities 
