summary</text_box>
				<text_box border_color="#00557F" border_width="2" border_style="solid" x="33.5" y="99.167" width="146.154" height="431.501">These results show
 
Left Side -
modelled CHP household visits and assessments versus records from the eCHIS service logging system.

Right Side - 
modelled CHP treatments versus recorded treatments. Supply availability is critical to the ability of CHPs to deliver these treatments.

Each subcounty, county or the whole country can be selected from the dropdown box. 

The next page shows a more detailed malaria dashboard.
</text_box>
